  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "台文通訊BONG報336期-編輯室ê話"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">時日來到3--月，總算無koh hiah厚雨，逐工lóng有出日頭mā ke tsiânn燒熱。Lán來看〈春天〉是啥mih款ê光景？〈遠足〉koh有啥mih趣味、深刻ê記憶？好天mā ē-tàng tuè〈外國人開發ê淡水kap洋風建築 〉ê跤跡真正去hia行行看看--leh。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">除了tuè季節ê跤步行，tsit期雜誌iáu有另外一个大齣頭，就是beh來kā lán各位讀者介紹「2021年阿却賞」tio̍h獎ê六篇散文。有leh講kap厝內人ê親情ê〈囡仔名〉、〈悾am囡仔ê記持〉、〈真相 〉、〈陪你向前行〉。Mā有leh講菜市仔生存撇步ê〈江湖〉kap描寫大甲ngiâ媽祖有啥體會ê〈難忘ê旅行〉。詳細內容到底是啥mih故事？逐家趕緊來看māi。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">春天花正清芳，祝福逐家lóng元氣滿滿、心情清爽！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg_vgYrk4hW-sy8lf_5007WQ2siEEHHQ-foS1E7yvfJKkirMC65Z5fzUrVV8MZeP7zzCt4Z9HTCRAvUNg9b8YhdCrfb-DQtLigzgbskNb4RX-s2gWOWqG8Lsg3ZlnKrEgXgXlwx5ec7HJujVca-CSxF1tpZ-JdSCgYyVhWG-vtyNpFz9FIdFS_qIemDTg/s1424/336%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg_vgYrk4hW-sy8lf_5007WQ2siEEHHQ-foS1E7yvfJKkirMC65Z5fzUrVV8MZeP7zzCt4Z9HTCRAvUNg9b8YhdCrfb-DQtLigzgbskNb4RX-s2gWOWqG8Lsg3ZlnKrEgXgXlwx5ec7HJujVca-CSxF1tpZ-JdSCgYyVhWG-vtyNpFz9FIdFS_qIemDTg/w450-h640/336%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgnEvi5aD-Zt64X_EGoin5vrSJuVyDVfYwOYJFg6Df3y38-Qe4msrj9S9P7UrBTwwP038YjYSFfrLrMBD_I7RvcZaCiRwgsxB1Rw945k73_XsZGlbmKi-1x-jgwh8v0HUPuNVqbREZnfWUvWibsAq1wsb5J8TAYNBi5O4NqtH6QAvaWGKj4K3HUb9q9GQ/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1336%E6%9C%9F_%E7%B7%A8%E8%BC%AF%E5%AE%A4.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgnEvi5aD-Zt64X_EGoin5vrSJuVyDVfYwOYJFg6Df3y38-Qe4msrj9S9P7UrBTwwP038YjYSFfrLrMBD_I7RvcZaCiRwgsxB1Rw945k73_XsZGlbmKi-1x-jgwh8v0HUPuNVqbREZnfWUvWibsAq1wsb5J8TAYNBi5O4NqtH6QAvaWGKj4K3HUb9q9GQ/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1336%E6%9C%9F_%E7%B7%A8%E8%BC%AF%E5%AE%A4.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7Es